usage: tcp_calibration [-h] {cad,record,solve,apply} ...

Read-only TCP collection, CAD inspection and fixed-point pivot calibration. No
motor commands, enabling, or automatic movement. Position pivot does NOT
estimate tool orientation or correct arm joint zeros/link geometry.

positional arguments:
  {cad,record,solve,apply}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
